76	// --- Shared plumbing for the dynamic resources below: all of them talk to Directus's own REST
77	// API rather than GCP's, authenticating as the bootstrap admin. This is the first place Pulumi
78	// authenticates to an application's own API rather than just GCP's — worth reading closely before
